  "description": "Based on a design from the collection Stray Aliens: #12 - Gale Elemeind\n\n\"Gale located our crew while we were housing her 3 sisters. We had no choice but to contain her in a separate holding to ensure everyone's safety. When the time is right, the sister can be fully reunited. Gale was insistent that if her sisters would be relocating to Earthereum, she will be too. Despite her unpredictable nature, we couldn't agree more!\n\nGale will be quite a handful as an adopted Stray, but she does usually have the best intentions. She can spread life & love, or she can fan the flames of conflict. She is quite adaptable! Gale is rowdy, has a massive appetite, and is usually a fun Stray to have around. Gale is traveling with a pet, which is not very common for a Stray Alien. We do not know what to expect from the friendly critter that appears to be very attached to her.\n\nWe are excited to see how Gale & the Elemeind sisters work together to help the human race. The sisters are eager to protect the people of Earth from the same destruction their own planet faced.\"",
